{"2026.5.8:P01-Q05":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>铍铝化学相似性与晶体类型</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 长沙市一中四月阶段检测 · 原题5 · P01-Q05</div><h1>铍铝化学相似性与晶体类型</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：比较氨配位、氯化物熔点、两性氢氧化物和氢化物遇酸。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">常见无机物及其应用/铝及其化合物/氢氧化铝</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/晶体结构与性质/常见几种晶体类型</span><span class=\"tag\">常见无机物及其应用/金属资源的开发与金属材料/其他金属及其化合物</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/盐类的水解/盐类水解原理</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>5. <img src=\"chem-asset:cb83da09b2ee8171d4c5af1c3251fad55328d29296d22ee05b1dc1532ad3946d:0;\" style=\"width:33.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:891485df6503d3f69f4bce0f97f3d04233b416046f75a292ecf7c1162b174b9e:1;\" style=\"width:29.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的电荷与半径之比相近，导致两元素性质相似。下列说法错误的是</p><p>A. <img src=\"chem-asset:cb83da09b2ee8171d4c5af1c3251fad55328d29296d22ee05b1dc1532ad3946d:0;\" style=\"width:33.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与<img src=\"chem-asset:891485df6503d3f69f4bce0f97f3d04233b416046f75a292ecf7c1162b174b9e:1;\" style=\"width:29.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">都能在水中与氨形成配合物</p><p>B. <img src=\"chem-asset:62f1cab5fbe341023426faaa22030b59ccf976f3609c76b45dddd8f992c61a70:2;\" style=\"width:43.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:68ba33490197b7e5616e646a685e1b739571064561c80c9211cf756f4e48db9b:3;\" style=\"width:36.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的熔点都比<img src=\"chem-asset:27edf8837d84f99ee85df91391de054f173c48047e0617fa5a18a9db0227b671:4;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的低</p><p>C. <img src=\"chem-asset:f077f87300521abf32af70b84717392bffb793236ea5ced53928bb6d4aa373df:5;\" style=\"width:65.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:c13aded393e1814a0a4e66a8c8f1a53b4855193c7d2037ff48c147a4573eb438:6;\" style=\"width:62.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">均可表现出弱酸性</p><p>D. <img src=\"chem-asset:16df2c28f6832b6c32cb9c7408464e1e48628c6e845c270a18dcc339b515fabf:7;\" style=\"width:22.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:8a9f6586a61d0da23ae92e3632926da8e09a7aaedb971858ac14239a86f4f93e:8;\" style=\"width:21.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的氢化物都不能在酸中稳定存在</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】A</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．Al<sup>3+</sup>与氨水反应只能生成氢氧化铝沉淀，不能与氨形成配合物，同理Be<sup>2+</sup>也不能在水中与氨形成配合物，A项错误；</p><p>B．<img src=\"chem-asset:62f1cab5fbe341023426faaa22030b59ccf976f3609c76b45dddd8f992c61a70:2;\" style=\"width:43.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:68ba33490197b7e5616e646a685e1b739571064561c80c9211cf756f4e48db9b:3;\" style=\"width:36.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">属于分子晶体，而<img src=\"chem-asset:27edf8837d84f99ee85df91391de054f173c48047e0617fa5a18a9db0227b671:4;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">属于离子晶体，则<img src=\"chem-asset:62f1cab5fbe341023426faaa22030b59ccf976f3609c76b45dddd8f992c61a70:2;\" style=\"width:43.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:68ba33490197b7e5616e646a685e1b739571064561c80c9211cf756f4e48db9b:3;\" style=\"width:36.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的熔点都比<img src=\"chem-asset:27edf8837d84f99ee85df91391de054f173c48047e0617fa5a18a9db0227b671:4;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的低，B项正确；</p><p>C．<img src=\"chem-asset:f077f87300521abf32af70b84717392bffb793236ea5ced53928bb6d4aa373df:9;\" style=\"width:65.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:c13aded393e1814a0a4e66a8c8f1a53b4855193c7d2037ff48c147a4573eb438:10;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">均为两性氢氧化物，则均可表现出弱酸性，C项正确；</p><p>D．<img src=\"chem-asset:16df2c28f6832b6c32cb9c7408464e1e48628c6e845c270a18dcc339b515fabf:7;\" style=\"width:22.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:8a9f6586a61d0da23ae92e3632926da8e09a7aaedb971858ac14239a86f4f93e:8;\" style=\"width:21.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的氢化物与酸反应，生成对应的盐和氢气，则都不能在酸中稳定存在，D项正确；</p><p>答案选A。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.8\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.8/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["16df2c28f6832b6c32cb9c7408464e1e48628c6e845c270a18dcc339b515fabf","27edf8837d84f99ee85df91391de054f173c48047e0617fa5a18a9db0227b671","62f1cab5fbe341023426faaa22030b59ccf976f3609c76b45dddd8f992c61a70","68ba33490197b7e5616e646a685e1b739571064561c80c9211cf756f4e48db9b","891485df6503d3f69f4bce0f97f3d04233b416046f75a292ecf7c1162b174b9e","8a9f6586a61d0da23ae92e3632926da8e09a7aaedb971858ac14239a86f4f93e","c13aded393e1814a0a4e66a8c8f1a53b4855193c7d2037ff48c147a4573eb438","cb83da09b2ee8171d4c5af1c3251fad55328d29296d22ee05b1dc1532ad3946d","f077f87300521abf32af70b84717392bffb793236ea5ced53928bb6d4aa373df"],"sourceSha256":"d0be616c003766261bf83f735e205bd080de1cf97dfdb8aaa7fbc22e832d4138"}}